# Domainerator scope file
# One entry per line. Entries may be a single IP or a CIDR subnet.
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# All testing is confined to hosts within these ranges; anything outside is
# refused before any tool runs.

# Example internal ranges
10.0.0.0/24
192.168.56.0/24

# A single host (the domain controller)
10.0.0.10
